			"Message": "feat(Common): Add DebugDapMessage and CustomEditorSaved IPC events\n\nAdd two new sky event channels to support debugging and custom editor workflows:\n- DebugDapMessage: Enables forwarding Debug Adapter Protocol messages between Mountain and the frontend\n- CustomEditorSaved: Notifies the UI when a custom editor document is saved\n\nThese events are defined in SkyEvent.rs using the DefineSkyEvents macro, following the existing pattern for debug and custom editor channels.",
