				342,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Common): Add optional Handle field to SourceControlCreateDTO\n\nAdd a caller-supplied provider handle field to enable Cocoon to provide its\nsequential allocator handle that Mountain uses to key its marker maps.\nPreviously, when Handle was absent, Mountain allocated handles independently,\nwhich caused \"Received group update for unknown provider handle\" warnings when\nCocoon sent group updates keyed under its own handle. This ensures\ngroup-update lookups resolve correctly and the SCM viewlet renders properly.",
			"SHA": "3b27de5db513ee92889f602b74445931860ff2f4"
		}
